{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to .mcp.json and replace every <...> with a real path.",
    ".mcp.json itself is gitignored: it names one machine's layout,",
    "and the bridge lives outside this repository.",
    "",
    "ghidra     the bridge to a running Ghidra. Several Ghidra projects",
    "           can share a machine and A PORT DOES NOT IDENTIFY ONE, so",
    "           GHIDRA_MCP_URL is deliberately NOT set - a write against",
    "           another project's database corrupts it. tools/gq.py finds",
    "           the server by project name and refuses any but rupture.",
    "           CLAUDE.md 2.1.",
    "",
    "           The same bridge carries the debugger_* tools. They proxy",
    "           to the pybag/dbgeng server in n:/DEV/xbdbg on",
    "           GHIDRA_DEBUGGER_URL and are inert unless it is running.",
    "           There is no second MCP server for it. CLAUDE.md 11.1."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "ghidra": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "<path to python.exe>",
      "args": [
        "<path to bridge_mcp_ghidra.py>"
      ],
      "env": {
        "GHIDRA_MCP_REQUIRE_PROGRAM_SELECTORS": "all",
        "GHIDRA_DEBUGGER_URL": "http://127.0.0.1:8099"
      }
    }
  }
}
